00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:39.390
korda minna, Lähme kusagilt mujale.

213
00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:44.890
Eks hommikul vaatame, kuhu lähme.
Aga kõige tähtsam on meeles midagi.

214
00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:50.770
Et ma siin hommikul tühja kõhuga
jälle alla ei prooviks kugistada.

215
00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:55.710
Tõesti paluks.

216
00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.110
Olge lahked.

217
00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:10.750
Loodus meile

218
00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:13.600
annab.

219
00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:16.960
Vett ja.

220
00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:19.210
Metsa.

221
00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:29.630
Tükki sinist taevast järve silma
looduses. Selles.

222
00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:36.530
Kuisa liiga palju.

223
00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:41.005
Nii et järe

224
00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.290
Metsa maal.

225
00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:52.130
On.

226
00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:55.140
Lihtsalt otsa saada.
